                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="8c1aWPSD6AwjClf69J2e-4" value="- Read, valid and load data from configuration file.&lt;div&gt;- Listen&amp;nbsp; t&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;o multiple ports. (socket)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;- Handle I/O&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;- Received request from clients.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- Handle the request from the client.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;- Static website&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;- HTTP redirection&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;-&amp;nbsp;Execution of CGI, based on file extension (for example .php).&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- Provide the according response with status code.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- Send response.&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;movable=1;resizable=1;rotatable=1;deletable=1;editable=1;locked=0;connectable=1;" parent="1" vertex="1">
